Have you never run into a chameleon before?  Ever wonder what rings of
protection from shape changers were for?  Chameleons can take on the
form of a great many of the monsters in nethack.  Typically, if they
are in a scary, but non-magical form, like a mastodon, all you have to
do is keep running it in circles until it changes form again.

I don't think polymorph traps can occur at level 11 or lower (which
you must have been to be at Oracle+2).  Mastodons are one of the
toughest monsters in the game... mostly because they have a bucket of
HPs (being level 20) and two 4d8 butt attacks.

